  "condition_on_previous_text": true,
  "duration_seconds": 303.09,
  "duration_after_vad_seconds": 282.656,
  "cue_count": 56,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.18,
      "end": 4.18,
      "text": "What is hydraulic fracturing or fracking?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128484,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029724
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 4.18,
      "end": 9.18,
      "text": "Since the Industrial Revolution our energy consumption has risen unceasingly.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128484,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029724
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 9.18,
      "end": 16.18,
      "text": "The majority of this energy consumption is supplied by fossil fuels like coal or natural gas.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128484,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029724
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 16.18,
      "end": 25.18,
      "text": "Recently there's been a lot of talk about a controversial method of extracting natural gas, hydraulic fracturing or fracking.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128484,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029724
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 25.18,
      "end": 30.18,
      "text": "Put simply, fracking describes the recovery of natural gas from deep layers inside the earth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069054,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 30.18,
      "end": 38.18,
      "text": "In this method porous rock is fractured by the use of water, sand and chemicals in order to release the enclosed natural gas.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069054,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 38.18,
      "end": 43.18,
      "text": "The technique of fracking has been known since the 1940s.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069054,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 43.18,
      "end": 50.18,
      "text": "Nonetheless, only in the last 10 years has there been quite a fracking boom, especially in the USA.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069054,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 50.18,
      "end": 58.18,
      "text": "This is because most conventional natural gas sources in America and on the European continent have been exhausted.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047641,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.025162
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 58.18,
      "end": 63.18,
      "text": "Thus prices for natural gas and other fuels are rising steadily.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047641,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.025162
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 63.18,
      "end": 70.18,
      "text": "Significantly more complicated and expensive methods like fracking have now become attractive and profitable.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047641,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.025162
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 70.18,
      "end": 76.18,
      "text": "In the meantime, fracking has already been used more than a million times in the USA alone.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047641,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.025162
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 76.18,
      "end": 82.18,
      "text": "Over 60% of all new oil and gas wells are drilled by using fracking.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073186,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002182
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 82.18,
      "end": 86.18,
      "text": "Now let's take a look at how fracking actually works.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073186,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002182
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 86.18,
      "end": 91.18,
      "text": "First, a shaft is drilled several hundred meters into the earth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073186,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002182
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 91.18,
      "end": 96.18,
      "text": "From there, a horizontal hole is drilled into the gas bearing layer of rock.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073186,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002182
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 96.18,
      "end": 101.18,
      "text": "Next, the fracking fluid is pumped into the ground using high performance pumps.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073186,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002182
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 102.18,
      "end": 106.18,
      "text": "On average, the fluid consists of 8 million litres of water,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.061047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 106.18,
      "end": 110.18,
      "text": "which amounts to about the daily consumption of 65,000 people,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.061047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 110.18,
      "end": 115.18,
      "text": "plus several thousand tons of sand and about 200,000 litres of chemicals.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.061047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 115.18,
      "end": 121.18,
      "text": "The mixture penetrates into the rock layer and produces innumerable tiny cracks.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.061047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 121.18,
      "end": 125.18,
      "text": "The sand prevents the cracks from closing again.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.061047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 125.18,
      "end": 128.18,
      "text": "The chemicals perform various tasks.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.061047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 128.18,
      "end": 134.18,
      "text": "Among other things, they compress the water, kill off bacteria or dissolve minerals.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 134.18,
      "end": 138.18,
      "text": "Next, the majority of the fracking fluid is pumped out again.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 138.18,
      "end": 142.18,
      "text": "And now the natural gas can be recovered.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 142.18,
      "end": 146.18,
      "text": "As soon as the gas source is exhausted, the drill hole is sealed.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 146.18,
      "end": 152.18,
      "text": "As a rule, the fracking fluid is pumped back into deep underground layers and sealed in there.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 152.18,
      "end": 157.18,
      "text": "However, fracking is also associated with several considerable risks.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 157.18,
      "end": 161.18,
      "text": "The primary risk consists in the contamination of drinking water sources.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054397,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009262
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 161.18,
      "end": 164.18,
      "text": "Fracking not only consumes large quantities of fresh water,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054397,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009262
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 164.18,
      "end": 169.18,
      "text": "but in addition, the water is subsequently contaminated and is highly toxic.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054397,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009262
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 169.18,
      "end": 176.18,
      "text": "The contamination is so severe that the water cannot even be cleaned in a treatment plant.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054397,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009262
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 176.18,
      "end": 180.18,
      "text": "Even though the danger is known and theoretically could be managed,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054397,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009262
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 180.18,
      "end": 186.42,
      "text": "in the USA already, sources have been contaminated due to negligence.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.054397,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009262
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 186.42,
      "end": 189.42,
      "text": "No one yet knows how the enclosed water will behave in the future,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.052351,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002018
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 189.42,
      "end": 194.42,
      "text": "since there have not yet been any long-term studies on the subject.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.052351,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002018
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 194.42,
      "end": 200.42,
      "text": "The chemicals used in fracking vary from the hazardous to the extremely toxic and carcinogenic,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.052351,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002018
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 200.42,
      "end": 203.42,
      "text": "such as benzol or formic acid.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.052351,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002018
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 203.42,
      "end": 212.43,
      "text": "The companies using fracking say nothing about the precise composition of the chemical mixture.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.052351,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002018
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 212.43,
      "end": 218.43,
      "text": "But it is known that there are about 700 different chemical agents which can be used in the process.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.052351,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002018
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 218.43,
      "end": 222.43,
      "text": "Another risk is the release of greenhouse gases.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.038821,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000743
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 222.43,
      "end": 227.43,
      "text": "The natural gas recovered by fracking consists largely of methane,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.038821,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000743
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 227.43,
      "end": 232.43,
      "text": "a greenhouse gas which is 25 times more potent than carbon dioxide.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.038821,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000743
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 232.43,
      "end": 236.43,
      "text": "Natural gas is less harmful than coal when burned.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.038821,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000743
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 236.43,
      "end": 242.43,
      "text": "But nonetheless, the negative effects of fracking on the climate balance are overall greater.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.038821,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000743
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 242.43,
      "end": 247.43,
      "text": "Firstly, the fracking process requires a very large consumption of energy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.038821,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000743
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 247.43,
      "end": 250.43,
      "text": "Secondly, the drill holes are quickly exhausted",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047194,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000495
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 250.43,
      "end": 256.43,
      "text": "and it's necessary to drill fracking holes much more frequently than for classical natural gas wells.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047194,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000495
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 256.43,
      "end": 264.43,
      "text": "In addition, about 3% of the recovered gas is lost in the extraction and escapes into the atmosphere.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047194,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000495
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 264.43,
      "end": 267.43,
      "text": "So how is fracking and its expected benefits to be assessed",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047194,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000495
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 267.43,
      "end": 271.43,
      "text": "when the advantages are balanced against the disadvantages?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047194,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000495
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 271.43,
      "end": 276.43,
      "text": "When properly employed, this technique offers one way in the short to medium term",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.047194,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000495
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 276.43,
      "end": 281.19,
      "text": "to meet our demand for lower cost energy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.106201
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 281.19,
      "end": 284.19,
      "text": "But the long term consequences of fracking are unforeseeable",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.106201
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 284.19,
      "end": 288.19,
      "text": "and the risk to our drinking water thus should not be underestimated.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.106201
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-11-12T19:13:58+0800"
}
